---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Release Wellness collects, uses, and protects your information."
>

  <article class="container-narrow section privacy">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted small">Effective: 2026-05-03</p>
    </header>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>1. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Your privacy is important. This Privacy Policy explains how Release
        Wellness collects, uses, and protects your information when you visit
        this website.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website is for informational purposes only and does not establish
        a therapist–client relationship.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>Information you provide</h3>
      <p>If you choose to email or call directly, you may share:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Phone number</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Automatically collected information</h3>
      <p>
        Cloudflare Web Analytics records aggregate, non-identifying information
        about visits to this site, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Pages visited</li>
        <li>Approximate visit time and duration</li>
        <li>Referring website (if any)</li>
        <li>Browser and device type</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This information helps improve the website experience.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>3. How Your Information Is Used</h2>
      <p>Your information may be used to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to inquiries</li>
        <li>Communicate with you if you request contact</li>
        <li>Help you schedule services</li>
        <li>Improve website performance</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell or share your personal information for marketing purposes.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>4. Secure Client Portal &amp; Protected Health Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you choose to become a client, Release Wellness uses SimplePractice
        for scheduling, documentation, and secure communication.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>The client portal is HIPAA-compliant</li>
        <li>Messages, forms, and records are securely stored</li>
        <li>Payment processing is handled through secure, encrypted systems</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Once services begin, your information is protected under HIPAA.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>5. Important Note About Website Communication</h2>
      <p>
        This website and standard email are not secure or confidential methods
        of communication.
      </p>
      <p>
        Please do not include sensitive personal or clinical information when
        contacting through email or phone outside of the secure portal.
      </p>
      <p>
        Secure communication will be provided through the SimplePractice client
        portal once you are established as a client.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>This website may link to or integrate with third-party platforms, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Psychology Today</li>
        <li>SimplePractice</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        These services have their own privacy policies. Release Wellness is not
        responsible for their data practices.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>7. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This website uses Cloudflare Web Analytics for traffic counts only. It
        is privacy-respecting and cookieless — it counts page views and
        referrers without setting cookies, fingerprinting visitors, or tracking
        individuals across sites. No third-party advertising or behavioral
        cookies are used.
      </p>
      <p>
        If your browser is configured to block scripts, the analytics will not
        load and the site will continue to function normally.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>8. California Privacy Rights</h2>
      <p>
        If you are a California resident, you may have rights under the
        California Consumer Privacy Act, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Requesting access to your personal data</li>
        <li>Requesting deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Requesting information about how your data is used</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To make a request, please contact us using the information below.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>9. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        Reasonable safeguards are used to protect your information. However, no
        system can guarantee absolute security.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>10. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This website is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly
        collect personal information from children through this site.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>11. Contact Information</h2>
      <address class="contact-block">
        Release Wellness
        <br />
        324 Avenida de La Estrella, Suite B
        <br />
        San Clemente, CA 92672
        <br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:tanya@releasewellnessca.com">tanya@releasewellnessca.com</a>
        <br />
        Phone: <a href="tel:+19496873899">(949) 687-3899</a>
      </address>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>12. Updates to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically. Changes will be posted
        on this page with an updated effective date.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>

</Base>

<style>
  .privacy header { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); }
  .privacy header .eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs); }
  .privacy .small { font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: var(--space-2xs); }

  .prose { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }
  .prose h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xs);
  }
  .prose ul {
    margin: var(--space-2xs) 0 var(--space-sm);
    padding-inline-start: 1.25rem;
  }
  .prose li { margin-block: 0.25rem; }

  .contact-block {
    font-style: normal;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding: var(--space-md);
    background: var(--color-sage-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
</style>
